msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/netdev.yaml:280
msgid ""
"PID of the napi thread, if NAPI is configured to operate in threaded mode. "
"If NAPI is not in threaded mode (i.e. uses normal softirq context), the "
"attribute will be absent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/netdev.yaml:286
msgid "defer-hard-irqs (``u32``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/netdev.yaml:286
msgid ""
"The number of consecutive empty polls before IRQ deferral ends and hardware "
"IRQs are re-enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/netdev.yaml:293
msgid "gro-flush-timeout (``uint``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/netdev.yaml:293
msgid ""
"The timeout, in nanoseconds, of when to trigger the NAPI watchdog timer "
"which schedules NAPI processing. Additionally, a non-zero value will also "
"prevent GRO from flushing recent super-frames at the end of a NAPI cycle. "
"This may add receive latency in exchange for reducing the number of frames "
"processed by the network stack."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/netdev.yaml:301
msgid "irq-suspend-timeout (``uint``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/netdev.yaml:301
msgid ""
"The timeout, in nanoseconds, of how long to suspend irq processing, if event "
"polling finds events"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/netdev.yaml:306
msgid "threaded (``u32``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/netdev.yaml:306
msgid ""
"Whether the NAPI is configured to operate in threaded polling mode. If this "
"is set to enabled then the NAPI context operates in threaded polling mode. "
"If this is set to busy-poll, then the threaded polling mode also busy polls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/netdev.yaml:306
msgid ":ref:`netdev-definition-napi-threaded`"
msgstr ""

